  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p001:m0000" ref="ex7_8jy_o48_A">郭祚</persName>，字<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p001:m0004" ref="ex7_8jy_o48_A">季祐</persName>，太原晉陽人</p>
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">父<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p002:m0001" ref="ex7_8jy_o48">洪之</persName>，坐<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p002:m0005" ref="yd9_rqt_a0v_AAB">浩</persName>事誅，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-064-guozuo-father:p002:m0009" ref="ex7_8jy_o48_A">祚</persName>亡竄得免。</p>
